    "description": "Some said I was insane to try to program a visual novel in wallpaper engine. They doubted me, said it couldn't be done. But here I stand. This is a complete remake of the Just Monika part of Doki Doki Literature Club.\n\nThis wallpaper features:\n- All 54 conversations from the original game (roughly 800 lines of dialogue)\n- 6 holiday specific conversations\n- Buttons and dialogue for the current date\n- Buttons and dialogue for the current time (in both 12 and 24 hour time)\n- Buttons to toggle the bloom, textbox, and music\n\nAlso there is a name textfield in the wallpaper settings to input your name, otherwise it defaults to MC.",
